title: Microsoft Hyper-V VM: Fixed virtual disk
agents: windows
catalog: os/storage
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check shows the file name, the size and the type of a fixed virtual
 disk of a virtual machine running on Microsoft Hyper-V.

 The check is always {OK}. Dynamic and differencing disks are monitored by
 the check {hyperv_vm_vhd_dynamic}.

 The data is collected by the agent plug-in {hyperv_host.ps1}, which can be
 deployed with the agent bakery rule "Hyper-V". The plug-in sends the data
 as piggyback data to a host with the name of the VM.

item:
 The controller type, the controller number and the location of the disk,
 for example {SCSI 0 1}.

discovery:
 One service is created for each fixed virtual disk.
